codex --worktree login: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `moedex fork`, `moedex exec`, and `moedex exec fork`
codex fork --worktree: `moedex fork --worktree` requires an explicit session ID
codex fork --worktree --last: `moedex fork --worktree` requires an explicit session ID
codex exec resume --worktree session: `--worktree` cannot resume an existing session; use `moedex exec fork --worktree`
codex exec review --worktree: `--worktree` is not supported for code review
codex resume --worktree session: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `moedex fork`, `moedex exec`, and `moedex exec fork`
codex archive session --worktree: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `moedex fork`, `moedex exec`, and `moedex exec fork`
codex queue --thread session --message hi --worktree: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `moedex fork`, `moedex exec`, and `moedex exec fork`
